dding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-04-11/03-dealignai-gemma-4-31b-jang-4m-crack.png\" alt=\"dealignai/Gemma-4-31B-JANG_4M-CRACK\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">dealignai/Gemma-4-31B-JANG_4M-CRACK</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Gemma-4-31B-JANG_4M-CRACK 是基于谷歌 Gemma-4-31B 架构的衍生模型，经过特殊数据集优化处理。该模型定位于特定场景下的深度推理与模式匹配，利用其 31B 的参数规模在复杂逻辑任务中提供稳定的性能支持，适合用于自动化数据分析、高级代码生成及特定语境下的生成式任务。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-04-11/04-openbmb-voxcpm2.png\" alt=\"openbmb/VoxCPM2\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section s